$ vault secrets enable -path=kubernetes kubernetes
Success! Enabled the kubernetes secrets engine at: kubernetes/

$ vault write kubernetes/config  (host + CA + reviewer JWT, disable_local_ca_jwt=true)
Success! Data written to: kubernetes/config

$ for R in viewer operator admin; do vault write kubernetes/roles/$R ...; done
Success! Data written to: kubernetes/roles/viewer
Success! Data written to: kubernetes/roles/operator
Success! Data written to: kubernetes/roles/admin
